  "name": "Death Defying",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/unholy/hand-fire-skeleton-pink.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 14th level, you refuse to fall while battle is still at hand.</p>\n<p>While you're raging, having 0 Hit Points doesn't knock you unconscious. You still must make death saving throws, and you suffer the normal effects of taking damage while at 0 hit points. However, if you would die due to failing death saving throws, you don't die until your rage ends, and you die then only if you still have 0 hit points.</p>",
